  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Independent Validation of Final Investment Monitoring Reports (FIMRs) 2025-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DFAT&apos;s Final Investment Monitoring Reports (FIMRs) are independently validated to ensure ratings are robust and evidence based. FIMRs are the final records of performance of DFAT aid investments of $3 million and over. 

FIMR validation is a core way DFAT fulfils its mandate to assure the quality and effectiveness of investments and verify performance data.</narrative>
  </description>
